import Common.Cutoffs
import Common.SobolevL6

/-!
# Common

Analytic tools shared verbatim by the Euler and Navier–Stokes libraries:
the dilated radius-1-to-2 bump cutoffs (`Common.Cutoffs`) and the fixed
homogeneous `H¹ → L⁶` Sobolev constant on `ℝ³` with its support-free
inequality (`Common.SobolevL6`).  Both modules depend only on Mathlib.
-/
